# 🎵 Resonate

A Spotify-style personal music player with mood-aware auto-play-next algorithm.

## Features
- Full 320kbps song streaming via JioSaavn
- Mood-aware auto-play-next algorithm
- Playlists (create, edit, delete)
- Saved albums
- Synced lyrics (LRCLIB)
- Spotify-style dark UI with animated visualizer
- 100% client-side — no database, no login

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 16 + TypeScript + Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui
- Zustand + localStorage (no DB)
- JioSaavn API (music) + LRCLIB (lyrics)

## Quick Start

npm install --legacy-peer-deps
npm run dev

Open http://localhost:3000

